---
import { portfolioData } from '../../data/portfolio';
import { renderProjects } from '../../lib/render';
const { projects } = portfolioData;
---

<section id="projects" class="scroll-mt-20 py-14 sm:py-20 border-t border-[var(--border)]">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[76rem] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-[46rem]">
      <p class="reveal text-label text-[var(--signal)] mb-2">02 · Project</p>
      <h2 class="reveal-wipe text-h2 text-[var(--fg)]">Projects running in production.</h2>
      <p class="reveal text-lead mt-3 text-[var(--muted-fg)]" style="--d: 0.08s">
        Các dự án thực tế từ tự động hóa hạ tầng Air-Gapped đến thiết kế nền tảng Cloud-Native.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div id="bind-projects" class="mt-10 sm:mt-14 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2" set:html={renderProjects(projects)}></div>
  </div>
</section>
